Package: vidtoascii
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-opencv, python3-numpy, python3-requests, yt-dlp, ffmpeg
Description: Terminal video player with colored ASCII pixels
 A Python-based CLI tool that streams local videos or YouTube links 
 directly into the terminal, rendering them as colored pixel blocks.
